$ HyWaves dynamic reference: one stationary case per time step, the offshore
$ hindcast at every goal; SWAN interpolates the spectra (energy) linearly
$ along the open boundary between them.
$ Physics as the metamodel cases (depth-induced breaking, bottom friction,
$ triads; whitecapping on), plus wind generation (GEN3, quadruplets on) when
$ the case has wind: a field (wind_file) or a uniform u10 / u10dir.
PROJECT 'HyWaves' '{{ "%04d" % case_num }}'
MODE STATIONARY TWODIMENSIONAL
COORDINATES SPHERICAL CCM
SET LEVEL={{ wl }} DEPMIN=0.1 NAUTICAL
$
CGRID UNSTRUCTURED CIRCLE 36 0.03 1.0 36
READGRID UNSTRUCTURED ADCIRC
{% set wind = (wind_file is defined) or (u10 is defined and u10) %}{% if wind_file is defined %}INPGRID WIND REGULAR {{ wind_grid }}
READINP WIND 1 '{{ wind_file }}' 3 0 FREE
{% elif wind %}WIND {{ u10 }} {{ u10dir }}
{% endif %}$
BOUND SHAPE JONSWAP 3.3 PEAK DSPR DEGREES
BOUNDSPEC SIDE {{ boundary_side }} VARIABLE PAR &
{% for row in boundary_par %}    {{ row }}{% if not loop.last %} &{% endif %}
{% endfor %}$
{% if wind %}GEN3
{% else %}OFF QUAD
{% endif %}BREAKING CONSTANT 1.0 0.73
FRICTION JONSWAP CONSTANT 0.038
TRIAD
NUMERIC STOPC 0.005 0.01 0.005 99.5 STATIONARY 50
$
POINTS 'sites' FILE '{{ points_file }}'
TABLE 'sites' NOHEAD '{{ table_file }}' {{ table_quantities }}
$ Grid map (save_map cases only):
{% if map_file %}BLOCK 'COMPGRID' NOHEAD '{{ map_file }}' LAY 3 {{ map_quantities }}
{% endif %}$ 2D spectra at the sites (not used by the pipeline):
$ SPECOUT 'sites' SPEC2D ABS 'output_sites.spc'
$
COMPUTE
STOP
